        "The club's invitations: through {{eventInvitations}} in the backoffice, a club administrator may enter your name and email address to send you one personal invitation to an event, with a place kept for you until a deadline. Basis: the club's legitimate interest in inviting its members, partners and guests (art. 6(1)(f) GDPR). We keep the name and address until you accept the invitation, the club withdraws it or its deadline passes; if you accept, they become your registration's data and are kept as such, otherwise we delete them as we do a registration whose address was never confirmed (section 7).",
